{"src":"en","tgt":"hi","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"hi","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7708.95516,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":11192.176098,"text":"यदि आपने “नेशनल ट्रेजर” फिल्म देखी है, तो आपको लग सकता है कि “स्वतंत्रता की घोषणा” के पीछे एक खजाने का नक्शा लिखा हुआ था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":11303.060296000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11307.949539000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11312.951681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11318.053571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":11323.552954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11328.992839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11334.089969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11336.017408000002,"samples":26824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":13872.552339000002,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":16558.63924,"text":"यह हॉट चॉकलेट बेल्जियम के मानकों के अनुरूप है। फलों के रस महँगे होते हैं, लेकिन थोड़ी देर बाद आप उनकी मिठास का स्वाद चख पाएँगे।"},{"kind":"audio","t":16669.680305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":540,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16674.297533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16679.435902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":16684.890066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":16689.932837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16695.222224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16700.698968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16702.351032000002,"samples":26224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":22205.470907,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":24860.039183,"text":"हालाँकि, यह सच नहीं है। हालाँकि दस्तावेज़ के पीछे कुछ लिखा हुआ है, लेकिन वह कोई खजाने का नक्शा नहीं है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":24955.879607000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24961.151254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24966.221045000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":24971.519032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24976.448654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24981.895409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24982.336042,"samples":15792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":29976.105929,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":33484.267995,"text":"आप अपने देश के अलावा अन्य सरकारों की सलाह भी लेना चाह सकते हैं, लेकिन उनकी सलाह उनके नागरिकों के लिए ही तैयार की गई होती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":33589.341584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33594.446313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33599.814919000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33604.992948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33609.95098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33615.127639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":33619.223244,"samples":