00,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128660.664223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128665.85543099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":128671.118718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128675.110986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128675.99254199999,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":134203.176539,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":137371.44718400002,"text":"यू.एस. कॉर्प्स ऑफ इंजीनियर्स का अनुमान है कि छह इंच वर्षा पहले से ही क्षतिग्रस्त स्थिति को और बिगाड़ सकती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":137460.075562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":137460.85514,"samples":8032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":137573.74051600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137578.991404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137584.83749200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137590.43381400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137596.117965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":137601.52548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":137601.868254,"samples":12192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141174.947651,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":145237.067424,"text":"विशेष रूप से, यह दावा किया जाता है कि सूक्ष्म अभिव्यक्तियों की सही व्याख्या करके कोई व्यक्ति झूठ बोल रहा है या नहीं, इसे पता लगाया जा सकता है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":145345.599319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145350.780227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145356.17348300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145361.358941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145366.449971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145371.708649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145376.69025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145380.979543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145381.229849,"samples":15656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":147228.643186,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":149004.57508500002,"text":"संरचना पर कोई ग्राफिटी बनाकर या खरोंचकर उस स्थल को खराब न करें।"},{"kind":"audio","t":149098.48028000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149103.633989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149109.139673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149114.32198100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149116.467058,"samples":25528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":154862.993548,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":158355.53998,"text":"बाघ की गर्जना शेर की गहरी आवाज़ वाली गर्जना जैसी नहीं होती, बल्कि यह गुर्राहट भरे, चिल्लाए गए शब्दों के समूह जैसी होती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":158464.57079700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158469.592018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158475.963098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158481.239645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":158485.614666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158490.83266400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158496.19795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158499.15271300002,"samples":29824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":161903.54706,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":164898.056335,"text":"20वीं शताब्दी के अनुसंधानों से पता चला है कि आनुवंशिक विविधता के दो स्रोत होते हैं – छिपे हुए एवं प्रकट हुए।"},{"kind":"audio","t":165001.147806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165006.512871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165011.801658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":165016.981547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165022.399092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":165027.521341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165031.22308300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":165031.476009,"samples":1024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":175106.026236,"code":1005}]}